c44 -- data/c42/README.md section 7A arm B, REPUBLISHED WIDE ENOUGH TO BE FALSIFIABLE
======================================================================================================
CONVENTION (verbatim from c42_weil.py, unchanged):
  W(g) = h(i/2)+h(-i/2) - g(0) log(pi) + (1/2pi) INT h(r) Re psi(1/4+ir/2) dr
         - 2 SUM_{n>=2} Lambda(n) n^{-1/2} g(log n)
  arm B: g(t) = exp(-t^2/2)  [s=1],  h(r) = sqrt(2 pi) exp(-r^2/2)
  POLE  channel: INT_{-U}^{+U} g(t)(e^{t/2}+e^{-t/2}) dt
  ARCH  channel: -g(0)(log pi + gammaE) + 2 INT_0^U [e^{-2t}g(0) - e^{-t/2}g(t)]/(1-e^{-2t}) dt
  PRIME channel: -2 SUM_{n <= nmax} Lambda(n) n^{-1/2} g(log n)
  THREE knobs: U (archimedean cutoff), nmax (prime cutoff), dps (working precision).

