   READ: the POLE channel is exactly inert (difference 0.0 at every U tested -- its
   integrand is g(t)e^{t/2} ~ e^{-t^2/2+t/2}, dead long before t=20). The ENTIRE U
   dependence sits in the ARCH channel, whose integrand tends to e^{-2t}, not to zero
   super-exponentially. That is the coefficient-bearing attribution c34 asks for.

